      "content": "i get what you're saying about perspectives, but it doesn't change the fact that existing is just heavy. every day is just this constant, uphill struggle to exist in a world that doesn't have a place for me. sometimes i just look at everything and think... wouldn't it be easier if i just didn't have to carry this anymore? if things could just be quiet?",
